# Part number uniqueness (409 with the reason in `detail`, compared after trim and upper-casing), update input rules,
# and the 404 for a missing row. A refused write changes nothing; a renamed or deleted part frees its number again.

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@AdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@AdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@RunId = {{$timestamp}}
@Key = ZZK{{RunId}}
@GhostPartId = 999999999

### [Setup][Parts] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][Parts] Login as admin (200 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Parts] Create part A (201 expected)
# @name partA
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}A", "name": "Conflict Part A", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 201

###

### [Setup][Parts] Create part B (201 expected)
# @name partB
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}B", "name": "Conflict Part B", "netUnitPrice": 200, "vatRatePercent": 18 }

?? status == 201

###

### [Negative][Parts] Create with an existing part number (409 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}B", "name": "Duplicate", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 409
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "A part with this part number already exists.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] Create with the number in lower case and padded (409 expected, normalized before the comparison)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "  {{Key.toLowerCase()}}b ", "name": "Duplicate", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 409
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "A part with this part number already exists.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] Update A to B's number (409 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{partA.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key.toLowerCase()}}b", "name": "Conflict Part A", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27, "version": {{partA.version}} }

?? status == 409
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "A part with this part number already exists.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] Update A with an unsupported VAT rate (422 expected, the current version does not matter)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{partA.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}A", "name": "Conflict Part A", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 10, "version": {{partA.version}} }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "VAT rate must be 5, 18, or 27.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] Update a missing part (404 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{GhostPartId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}G", "name": "Ghost", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27, "version": 1 }

?? status == 404
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Part not found.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] Delete a missing part (404 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{GhostPartId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 404
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Part not found.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] Get a missing part (404 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{GhostPartId}}

?? status == 404
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Part not found.") == true

###

### [Positive][Parts] The refused writes changed nothing (200 expected, A keeps its number, name and version)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{partA.id}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.partNumber == {{Key}}A
?? js (response.parsedBody.name === "Conflict Part A") == true
?? js response.parsedBody.vatRatePercent == 27
?? js (response.parsedBody.version == partA.version) == true

###

### [Positive][Parts] Rename A to a free number (204 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{partA.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}C", "name": "Conflict Part A", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27, "version": {{partA.version}} }

?? status == 204

###

### [Positive][Parts] The number A gave up is free for a new part (201 expected)
# @name reusedA
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}A", "name": "Reused A", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 201

###

### [Positive][Parts] Deleting B frees its number (204 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{partB.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Positive][Parts] The number of the deleted part is free for a new part (201 expected)
# @name reusedB
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}B", "name": "Reused B", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 201

###

### [Cleanup][Parts] Delete the renamed part (204 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{partA.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Cleanup][Parts] Delete the part that reused A's number (204 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{reusedA.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Cleanup][Parts] Delete the part that reused B's number (204 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{reusedB.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204
